 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Redistribute all house numbers of houses among the neighborhoods so that every neighborhood keeps its size, holds no repeated number and is sorted ascending. To make the answer unique: fill neighborhoods in input order; each takes, among the numbers still to place, its size many distinct numbers with the most remaining copies, preferring the smaller number on equal copies. Return the result, or [] when no valid arrangement exists (this filling succeeds exactly when some valid arrangement exists).",
